{"id":"Wfe3ebd3c238b472cb8cf6fbb","zh":"希尔伯特−黄变换","en":"","name":"希尔伯特−黄变换","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wfe3ebd3c238b472cb8cf6fbb","text":"希尔伯特−黄变换","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S8a13d693cb34158fc00d","source_id":"P122","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"我国对轨道不平顺谱密度进行了长期的试验研究,但对我国重载铁路轨道不平顺谱密度尚缺乏深入系统的研究,本文作者基于实测朔黄铁路轨道不平顺样本数据,主要从轨道不平顺谱分析的角度分析了朔黄重载铁路的轨道不平顺状态;研究并给出了能良好表征朔黄铁路不平顺状态的轨道不平顺谱拟合公式及其特征参数,为朔黄铁路工程设计、施工及管理提供基本参数;同时,为更好的实现轨道不平顺状态评估及维护管理,初步研究了基于PSD−希尔伯特−黄变换(HHT)的轨道不平顺状态分析方法,能更好的发现轨道不平顺幅频变化特征。","citations":[{"source_id":"P122","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P122":{"id":"P122","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,李晓健,孟宪洪","year":"2013","doi":null,"journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"结合经验模式分解与希尔伯特谱，细化局部不平顺特征。","language":"zh","source_id":"P122","paper_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wae32304a3e11414a86ce306d","name":"Hilbert−Huang transform (HHT)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wae32304a3e11414a86ce306d","name":"Hilbert−Huang transform (HHT)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wae32304a3e11414a86ce306d","name":"Hilbert−Huang transform (HHT)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"